# CI / YAML Style

- Use consistent indentation (2 spaces).
- Anchor and alias (`&` / `*`) to avoid duplicating blocks.
- Keep pipeline jobs focused -- one responsibility per job.
- Use meaningful job and stage names that describe what they do.
